Package: uncertaintyproject
Title: Reception of the Uncertainty Project: Bibliographic Coupling and Citation Analysis
Version: 1.1.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Marco", "Schirone", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-4166-153X"))
Description: Research compendium for the study of the reception of the five
    Uncertainty Project papers (JASIST, 2002). A targets pipeline validates a
    Web of Science citing corpus with a close-reading correction layer,
    reconstructs the intellectual base of the five Parts, couples each citing
    paper to it, and runs the sensitivity, temporal and citation-function
    analyses reported in the article. Synthetic demonstration data allow the
    pipeline to run without the licensed exports.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
